WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:02.402
Turnover and triage in Ukraine today.

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:04.471
The shakeup at the top of Ukraine's

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:05.672
military ranks.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:06.039
President

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:07.407
Zelensky dismissing

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:08.641
the commander of joint force

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:09.909
operations Mr.

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:12.779
Zelensky did not explain why or why now,

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:14.147
as this leadership shuffle

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.482
collides with a new Russian

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:17.250
offensive overnight.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.551
A staggered drone assault.

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:19.853
14 Iranian

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:21.121
made unmanned attack

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:23.123
aircraft buzzing over Kiev.

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:23.790
Ukrainian air

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.258
defenses say they shot down

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:27.093
11 of those drones

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:27.660
in Ukraine,

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.462
south and east Moscow

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:30.930
trying to fracture the line.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.466
Russia launching 81 artillery strikes

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.368
over the last 24 hours.

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:36.603
Russia hopes the bombing

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:37.504
frenzy chokes off

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:38.738
Ukrainian forces

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:39.939
in and around block mount

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:42.142
and breaks a battlefield stalemate.

00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:44.477
Let's begin in eastern Ukraine with CNN's

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:45.645
Alex Marquardt with the latest

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:46.312
from the battlefield.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.013
Alex,

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:50.383
Well, John, absolutely right.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.385
A pivotal moment in this fight

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.421
and as we focus

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:55.822
on the fighting in the east.

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:57.457
We have also been reminded that

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.526
Russia continues to try to bomb

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:02.195
cities all across Ukraine with drones.

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:03.129
Overnight,

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.064
at least two people

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:06.232
killed in the city of criminal Nowitzki,

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:07.867
that is in southwestern Ukraine.

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:09.302
Very far from the front line.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.136
They were both

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:11.271
first responders

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:13.339
who were responding to an earlier

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.441
strike by a drone,

00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:16.676
a so-called double tap attack.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:18.845
Then there were some 11 drones

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:20.580
that were sent over Kiev.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.315
Nine of those shot down.

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:24.417
They were sent in at least two waves.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:25.285
And the air raid

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:26.386
sirens in Kiev

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:27.720
ringing out for some five

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.389
and a half hours.

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:31.224
A reminder that even as life continues

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:32.358
relatively normally

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:33.960
in many cities all across the country,

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:34.794
there is

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:36.463
the constant possibility

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:37.230
that those cities

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.032
may be attacked by drone.

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:40.467
But the fiercest fighting,

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:41.701
John, is taking place

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:42.302
in the eastern

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:42.902
part of the country,

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:45.171
particularly around the eastern city

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:45.939
of back.

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.740
It does appear that Russian forces,

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.542
primarily from the Volga mercenary

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:51.678
group, are making some progress.

00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:52.545
They claim that they have

00:01:52.545 --> 00:01:54.280
taken several villages

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.415
north of the city

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:57.450
as they try to encircle it.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.853
Ukrainian forces say that they are

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:01.988
standing their ground,

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:04.023
that they are repelling attacks.

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:04.891
We have not heard

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:06.159
any talk from the highest levels

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:07.093
of the Ukrainian government

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:09.629
about surrendering this city.

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:10.730
But President Zelinsky

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.832
softening his tone on that, saying

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:15.802
that he will not defend it at all costs.

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:17.804
We're watching that very carefully.

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:18.905
At the same time

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:20.006
as this general

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:21.174
whose area of command

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:22.909
was much of the east, Major

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:24.744
General Edward Muscala

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:26.980
was dismissed by a presidential decree

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.548
with little explanation from presidents

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.216
once his office. John.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:31.050
Alex Marquardt

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.619
live for us on the ground in Ukraine.

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:33.553
Alex, thanks for that update.

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:34.721
Let's get some important perspective

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:35.588
now from the former director

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:36.689
and deputy director

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:39.292
of National Intelligence, Beth Center.

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:40.927
Beth, to the point of this shakeup,

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:42.028
no explanation.

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:43.396
You relieved from duty,

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:45.532
a top official in the military command.

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:46.699
There has been a purge

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:48.835
an anti-corruption purge of late.

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:50.103
But no explanation here.

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:51.571
Does it come as a surprise?

00:02:51.571 --> 00:02:52.505
What does it tell you

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:53.106
at a time when,

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:53.373
you know

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:54.174
Russia is picking up

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:55.842
the pace of its attacks?

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:56.176
Well, there

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:57.510
hasn't been much turnover

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:58.978
actually in the Ukrainian

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:00.146
command structure.

00:03:00.146 --> 00:03:01.648
And so, you know,

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:03.216
I think these things happen.

00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:04.717
It could be one of two things either.

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:06.386
It's part of the corruption probe

00:03:06.386 --> 00:03:08.321
or its dissatisfaction

00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:09.289
in some way

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:12.358
or inability to carry out the orders

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:13.993
or the offensive that's planned.

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:15.528
So we will find out soon

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:16.429
enough about that.

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:18.031
But I think that, you know,

00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:20.066
making a hard decision in wartime,

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:21.968
it's actually may be a good sign.

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:23.803
And so you have over the weekend

00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:24.837
something quite remarkable.

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:27.040
The CIA director publicly

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.741
talking about a warning to China,

00:03:28.741 --> 00:03:30.109
talking about what his agency,

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:30.910
what the intelligence community

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.312
has learned about China.

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:33.246
Connect the dots for me.

00:03:33.246 --> 00:03:34.781
You just heard in the lead up.

00:03:34.781 --> 00:03:37.283
Iranian made drones over Kiev.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:38.218
And now Bill

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:39.786
Burns, the CIA director, saying

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:41.387
we have intelligence and China

00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:41.921
don't do it.

00:03:43.223 --> 00:03:44.791
We're confident that

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:45.992
the Chinese leadership

00:03:45.992 --> 00:03:47.794
is considering the provision

00:03:47.794 --> 00:03:49.162
of lethal equipment.

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:50.630
We also don't see that

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:54.300
a final decision has been made yet.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.703
It takes a process to even say

00:03:56.703 --> 00:03:57.704
that some people would say, well,

00:03:57.704 --> 00:03:59.038
he didn't say much.

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:00.306
But for the CIA director to say

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:01.741
that publicly takes a process.

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:05.078
Why this is part of a strategy.

00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:07.513
It's like an actual policy and strategy

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:09.749
by this White House to use intelligence

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:12.018
to declassify it, to release it

00:04:12.018 --> 00:04:13.553
publicly in order

00:04:13.553 --> 00:04:16.823
to affect the decisions of adversaries.

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:18.157
So in this case, it's

00:04:18.157 --> 00:04:20.293
designed to deter China.

00:04:20.293 --> 00:04:21.494
It's also designed

00:04:21.494 --> 00:04:22.161
to make sure

00:04:22.161 --> 00:04:24.697
that the Europeans are onside

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:26.933
about the threat that China poses

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:27.433
and the threat

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:29.502
that China and Russia pose together.

00:04:29.502 --> 00:04:30.436
So I think

00:04:30.436 --> 00:04:31.638
it's going to be very effective

00:04:31.638 --> 00:04:33.239
when Biden said this weekend.

00:04:33.239 --> 00:04:33.506
Look,

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:34.207
I don't really think

00:04:34.207 --> 00:04:35.041
that they're going to follow

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:36.242
through with this.

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:37.143
I agree with that,

00:04:37.143 --> 00:04:38.444
because now that it's out there

00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:39.178
and it's called,

00:04:39.178 --> 00:04:40.480
it makes it really hard

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.581
for China to do this

00:04:41.581 --> 00:04:43.549
because they need the U.S.

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:44.984
and Europe economically.

00:04:44.984 --> 00:04:46.252
We have talked from the beginning

00:04:46.252 --> 00:04:47.520
of the Ukraine conflict

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.022
not only about how this Putin process,

00:04:49.022 --> 00:04:49.889
this and NATO's

00:04:49.889 --> 00:04:51.024
resolve in the US was all,

00:04:51.024 --> 00:04:53.192
but how does President Xi process this?

00:04:53.259 --> 00:04:53.760
Nick Burns,

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:54.761
the ambassador to China, said

00:04:54.761 --> 00:04:55.995
at an event earlier today

00:04:55.995 --> 00:04:56.763
that he thinks

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:58.364
she is surprised

00:04:58.364 --> 00:04:59.098
by the strength

00:04:59.098 --> 00:05:00.833
of the world's democracies.

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:01.668
Is that right?

00:05:02.135 --> 00:05:03.936
Yeah, I think so. I think so.

00:05:03.936 --> 00:05:05.505
And I think that this is the reason

00:05:05.505 --> 00:05:07.173
we've seen a shift in China's

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:09.342
approach toward the rest of the world.

00:05:09.542 --> 00:05:11.978
Instead of the wolf warriors,

00:05:11.978 --> 00:05:12.979
these diplomats

00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:14.714
that go to European capitals

00:05:14.714 --> 00:05:16.082
or in European capitals

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:17.917
and are really, really super tough.

00:05:17.917 --> 00:05:20.186
Instead, we're seeing a charm offensive

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:22.088
trying to put things back together

00:05:22.088 --> 00:05:22.922
because they need

00:05:22.922 --> 00:05:23.956
that trade

00:05:23.956 --> 00:05:25.558
as trying to try to recover

00:05:25.558 --> 00:05:26.959
from the COVID crisis.

00:05:26.959 --> 00:05:28.828
So the United States is publicly warning

00:05:28.828 --> 00:05:30.096
China there will be consequences.

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:30.563
Don't do it.

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:31.197
Do not send

00:05:31.197 --> 00:05:32.932
lethal weapons to Vladimir Putin.

00:05:32.932 --> 00:05:34.167
One of the Chinese responses,

00:05:34.167 --> 00:05:34.534
no one,

00:05:34.534 --> 00:05:36.502
they say we weren't planning that, which,

00:05:36.502 --> 00:05:36.803
you know,

00:05:36.803 --> 00:05:38.104
just take that with a grain of salt,

00:05:38.104 --> 00:05:38.438
I guess.

00:05:38.438 --> 00:05:38.938
But number two,

00:05:38.938 --> 00:05:40.340
they say, well, you're hypocrites.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.240
You're sending weapons

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:42.542
into the battlefield.

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:43.910
One of the big questions right now

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.244
is, will will the West?

00:05:45.244 --> 00:05:46.713
Will the United States or others

00:05:46.713 --> 00:05:48.014
send fighter jets?

00:05:48.014 --> 00:05:49.349
President Biden was asked about this on

00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:50.817
Friday, and he says not now.

00:05:52.819 --> 00:05:54.187
You don't think he needs F-16s now?

00:05:54.187 --> 00:05:55.722
No, he doesn't need F-16s now.

00:05:55.722 --> 00:05:57.690
There is no basis upon

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.759
which there is a rationale,

00:05:59.759 --> 00:06:01.661
according to our military now,

00:06:01.661 --> 00:06:03.329
to provide F-16s.

00:06:03.329 --> 00:06:04.697
But you're not ruling it out?

00:06:04.697 --> 00:06:07.266
I am really not for now.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.167
Does that hold?

00:06:08.167 --> 00:06:09.936
We have seen month by month

00:06:09.936 --> 00:06:10.436
in this

00:06:10.436 --> 00:06:11.671
now in its second year

00:06:11.671 --> 00:06:12.438
beginning the second year

00:06:12.438 --> 00:06:14.273
of the conflict, a change in U.S.

00:06:14.273 --> 00:06:15.842
posture and NATO's posture,

00:06:15.842 --> 00:06:17.143
other Western allies posture

00:06:17.143 --> 00:06:18.111
about the

00:06:18.111 --> 00:06:19.846
the muscular nature of the weapons

00:06:19.846 --> 00:06:20.847
they will give.

00:06:20.847 --> 00:06:23.049
Why no F-16s

00:06:23.049 --> 00:06:25.218
So when Jake Sullivan and others

00:06:25.218 --> 00:06:25.852
say that

00:06:25.852 --> 00:06:27.420
they don't need the F-16s

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.722
now, that what they really need

00:06:30.022 --> 00:06:31.391
is more artillery

00:06:31.391 --> 00:06:33.526
and more of what we've been giving them.

00:06:33.526 --> 00:06:34.660
I agree with that.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.362
But I also agree with generals

00:06:36.362 --> 00:06:38.131
who say the phrase is,

00:06:38.131 --> 00:06:39.365
you have to be prepared

00:06:39.365 --> 00:06:41.033
not just to fight the war of today,

00:06:41.033 --> 00:06:42.602
but the war of tomorrow.

00:06:42.602 --> 00:06:43.836
And this is where the critics,

00:06:43.836 --> 00:06:45.438
I think are also right,

00:06:45.438 --> 00:06:47.373
is you've got to put everything in place

00:06:47.373 --> 00:06:49.242
to get those F-16s

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:50.910
there when you're ready to do so.

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:53.613
And so we talked a minute ago about China

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.281
and its local politics,

00:06:55.281 --> 00:06:56.115
the internal politics.

00:06:56.115 --> 00:06:57.417
What about Russian internal politics?

00:06:57.417 --> 00:06:58.818
Vladimir Putin gives this interview

00:06:58.818 --> 00:07:00.153
over the weekend.

00:07:00.153 --> 00:07:00.686
Listen to this.

00:07:00.686 --> 00:07:02.855
No one it's dated, if you will.

00:07:02.855 --> 00:07:05.124
It's a fantasy of how the world is today.

00:07:05.258 --> 00:07:06.325
But what does he mean by this

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:09.328
We cannot see.

00:07:09.328 --> 00:07:09.662
They have

00:07:09.662 --> 00:07:10.563
one goal

00:07:10.563 --> 00:07:11.531
to break up the former

00:07:11.531 --> 00:07:13.499
Soviet Union, in its main part,

00:07:13.499 --> 00:07:14.934
the Russian Federation.

00:07:14.934 --> 00:07:17.270
And then perhaps they will accept us

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:18.671
in the so-called family

00:07:18.671 --> 00:07:20.273
of civilized peoples,

00:07:20.273 --> 00:07:21.707
but only separately,

00:07:21.707 --> 00:07:23.109
each part separately.

00:07:23.109 --> 00:07:25.578
Moreover, in today's conditions,

00:07:25.578 --> 00:07:27.447
when all the leading natal countries

00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:28.848
have declared their main goal,

00:07:28.848 --> 00:07:30.983
to inflict a strategic defeat on us

00:07:31.284 --> 00:07:33.586
so that our people suffer,

00:07:33.586 --> 00:07:35.888
how can we, under these conditions,

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:37.023
not take into account

00:07:37.023 --> 00:07:39.225
their nuclear potentials

00:07:39.225 --> 00:07:40.827
Two things jumped out at me.

00:07:40.827 --> 00:07:41.661
You're way smarter than me

00:07:41.661 --> 00:07:42.328
when it comes to how

00:07:42.328 --> 00:07:43.429
he thinks, so help me.

00:07:43.429 --> 00:07:44.430
Number one, the nuclear

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.132
potential nuclear potentials.

00:07:46.132 --> 00:07:47.166
He waves that flag

00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:48.734
when he feels it's in his interest

00:07:48.734 --> 00:07:49.869
that, well, they have nuclear weapons

00:07:49.869 --> 00:07:50.937
and they don't like us.

00:07:50.937 --> 00:07:52.738
But they have one goal to break up.

00:07:52.738 --> 00:07:53.139
The former

00:07:53.139 --> 00:07:54.474
Soviet Union and its main

00:07:54.474 --> 00:07:55.441
part of the Soviet

00:07:55.441 --> 00:07:56.642
Union's been broken up for a long time,

00:07:56.642 --> 00:07:57.910
at least to use the word former

00:07:57.910 --> 00:07:58.578
what is he

00:07:58.578 --> 00:07:59.679
what is he trying to communicate

00:07:59.679 --> 00:08:00.780
to the people at home there?

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:02.048
He's trying to communicate

00:08:02.048 --> 00:08:02.815
what the Russians

00:08:02.815 --> 00:08:04.684
call strategic depth,

00:08:04.684 --> 00:08:06.786
which means that he's got this

00:08:07.119 --> 00:08:10.556
this alliance of former Soviet states,

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:12.992
including like Central Asia,

